      "declaration": "store6-mutations/org.mobilenativefoundation.store6.mutations/MutationCodec\nMutationCodec\n@ExperimentalStoreApi\ninterface MutationCodec<T : Any>\n\nVersioned byte codec for mutation arguments and store values.\n\nCodecs are pure and deterministic for a given version. The library defensively copies every encoded array before durable retention and passes a fresh copy into every decode, so consumer code can never mutate a stored retry generation. decode receives the persisted version, which may be older",
